# MVP Scope

## Purpose

The MVP defines the smallest useful version of Fatoora.

The goal is not to build a full accounting system.  
The goal is to build a polished mobile-first invoicing app that helps Arab freelancers create and share professional invoices quickly.

## MVP Goal

A user should be able to:

1. Register or log in
2. Set up basic business information
3. Add clients
4. Create invoices
5. Add invoice items
6. Automatically calculate totals
7. Generate an Arabic or English PDF invoice
8. Share the invoice through WhatsApp or email
9. Track invoice status

## Core User Journey

The main journey of the MVP is:

1. User opens the app
2. User logs in
3. User adds business profile information
4. User adds a client
5. User creates a new invoice
6. User adds invoice items
7. App calculates subtotal and total
8. User previews the invoice PDF
9. User shares the PDF with the client
10. User updates invoice status later

## Included Features

### Authentication

The MVP includes:

- Register with email and password
- Login with email and password
- JWT-based authentication
- Basic protected routes

The MVP does not include:

- Social login
- Magic links
- Two-factor authentication
- Password reset flow

### Business Profile

The MVP includes:

- Freelancer name
- Business name
- Email
- Phone number
- Default currency
- Default language

The MVP does not include:

- Logo upload
- Multiple businesses
- Team members
- Company verification

### Client Management

The MVP includes:

- Add client
- Edit client
- Delete client
- View client list

Client fields:

- Name
- Email
- Phone
- Address
- Notes

The MVP does not include:

- Client portal
- Client login
- Client payment history
- Advanced CRM features

### Invoice Management

The MVP includes:

- Create invoice
- View invoice list
- View invoice details
- Edit draft invoice
- Delete draft invoice
- Change invoice status

Invoice statuses:

- Draft
- Unpaid
- Paid
- Overdue

The MVP does not include:

- Recurring invoices
- Invoice templates management
- Advanced filters
- Accounting reports

### Invoice Items

The MVP includes:

- Add item description
- Add quantity
- Add unit price
- Calculate item total
- Calculate invoice subtotal
- Calculate invoice total

The MVP does not include:

- Product inventory
- Saved products
- Stock management

### PDF Generation

The MVP includes:

- Arabic PDF layout
- English PDF layout
- Basic RTL support
- Freelancer information
- Client information
- Invoice items table
- Totals
- Notes

The MVP does not include:

- Multiple visual templates
- Advanced branding
- Tax authority compliance
- Digital signature

### Sharing

The MVP includes:

- Share generated PDF through the native mobile share sheet
- WhatsApp sharing through the system share menu
- Email sharing through the system share menu

The MVP does not include:

- Direct WhatsApp Business API integration
- In-app email sending
- Payment links

### Dashboard

The MVP includes:

- Total invoices count
- Paid invoices count
- Unpaid invoices count
- Overdue invoices count
- Recent invoices list

The MVP does not include:

- Revenue charts
- Monthly reports
- Tax reports
- Analytics dashboard

## Explicit Non-goals

The following features are not part of the MVP:

- Online payments
- Subscriptions
- Teams
- Inventory
- ZATCA compliance
- Tax authority integrations
- Web dashboard
- AI invoice generation
- Multi-business accounts
- Advanced accounting
- Client portal

## MVP Success Criteria

The MVP is complete when a user can successfully complete this flow:

1. Register a new account
2. Log in
3. Add business information
4. Add one client
5. Create one invoice with at least two items
6. Generate a clean Arabic PDF
7. Share the PDF using the phone share menu
8. Mark the invoice as paid

## Quality Bar

The MVP should feel small but polished.

Important quality requirements:

- Clean mobile UI
- Good Arabic typography
- Proper RTL support
- Clear error messages
- Strong form validation
- No hardcoded user data
- No exposed secrets
- No broken invoice calculations
- No confusing navigation